1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,545
Tractor to hai, par sirf apne khet mein chalta hai. Baaki samay khada rehta hai.

2
00:00:05,845 --> 00:00:12,081
Jagdish, khada tractor paisa khaata hai! Kiraye pe chala, custom hiring centre khol!

3
00:00:12,381 --> 00:00:15,142
Baaki machinein kahan se laaun, Sarpanch ji?

4
00:00:15,442 --> 00:00:22,522
Rotavator, seed drill aur thresher, lagbhag 3 lakh. Is pe sarkari subsidy bhi milti hai.

5
00:00:22,822 --> 00:00:29,662
Chhote kisaanon ke paas machine nahi hoti. Buwai aur katai mein sabse zyada maang hogi.

6
00:00:30,212 --> 00:00:35,632
Jagdish beta, kal mere khet ki jutai kar do. Bail ab boodhe ho gaye!

7
00:00:35,932 --> 00:00:39,577
Subah-subah pahunch jaaunga, Kaka. 1,500 rupaye ekad.

8
00:00:39,877 --> 00:00:44,816
Season mein roz 3-4 ekad, yaani 4 hazaar se zyada roz.

9
00:00:45,116 --> 00:00:49,398
Mobile pe booking le, aur aas-paas ke paanch gaon cover kar.

10
00:00:49,698 --> 00:00:52,980
Tractor chala, paisa chala! Jagdish ki life set!
